Untitled.canvas
Untitled.base
*.canvas
*.base

# Personal career documents (resume, Upwork profile copy) - not project source.
career/

# Personal trading rulebook / life record (2026-09-21, Anoop's instruction:
# "do not give my data of the app"). Prop Trading/CLAUDE.md carries his name,
# email, city, four Tradovate account IDs, a Lucid dashboard userKey, his
# lifetime loss figure and a full per-session P&L log. It has NEVER been on the
# remote — origin/main has no Prop Trading/ tree at all — and this keeps it that
# way. The folder stays on disk and stays tracked-out; deleting this line plus
# `git add "Prop Trading"` puts it back if he ever decides otherwise.
# NOTE: the same file is ALSO written to by hand during sessions, so it must
# never be swept in by a bare `git add -A`.
Prop Trading/

# Vision-bridge tooling scratch (2026-09-21). Same class as .dsh-filess/ and
# .dsh-plugins/ above: an agent tool's own working directory — an npm cache
# (.npm-cache/_cacache, thousands of files), one-off recon scripts, logs — not
# part of this project. It sat untracked and would have been swept in by a bare
# `git add -A`.
.dsh-vision-bridge/

# ── LOCAL-ONLY WORKING CONTEXT (2026-09-22) ─────────────────────────────────
# Anoop, after the prune: "this project was handled by claude previously so
# deleting file will effect and there is no MD file stating how this project
# works. i want you to keep everything locally do not delete anything local."
#
# Every file below is BACK ON DISK and stays there. They are listed here only so
# that (a) they no longer clutter `git status`, and (b) a bare `git add -A`
# cannot put session handoffs and one-off utility scripts into a public push -
# which is how several of these got published in the first place.
#
# HANDOVER / WORKING CONTEXT - the running conversation between Anoop and the
# agent that builds this app, session by session. HOW_MNQ_COPILOT_WORKS.md in
# particular is the plain-language "how does this thing work" guide for someone
# who has never traded and never read the code.
CLAUDE_HANDOFF_2026-09-04.md
CLAUDE_HANDOFF_INDIA_DESK_2026-09-06.md
CLAUDE_HANDOFF_QUESTIONNAIRE_2026-09-09.md
CLAUDE_PROPOSAL_2026-09-04.md
DSH_START_HERE.md
DSH_PROJECT_HANDOFF.md
DSH_F0_F4_ACCEPTANCE_FIXES.md
DSH_INDIA_DESK_PLAN.md
DSH_TRADE_FORENSICS_PLAN.md
HOW_MNQ_COPILOT_WORKS.md
TRADINGVIEW_MCP_AUDIT.md
bug-audit-report-2026-08-12.md
PART6_IMPLEMENTATION_RUNBOOK.md
